``` IX-06 | Events Landing With Future or Ancient Timestamps
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry IX-06. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH.
    Query: Indexes already holding future-dated events
    If this returns nothing, run probes/IX-06-probe.spl to confirm the data it
    reads exists here.
```
| tstats max(_time) as newest_event where index=* earliest=-1d latest=+10y
    by index sourcetype
| where newest_event > now() + 300
| eval minutes_in_future=round((newest_event - now()) / 60, 0)
| convert ctime(newest_event)
| sort - minutes_in_future
